          <title xml:lang="en" ref="http://syriaca.org/work/181">Gospel Harmony (literary tradition)</title> is an undifferentiated literary tradition designating any harmony of <title xml:lang="en" ref="http://syriaca.org/work/9645">The Four Gospels (literary tradition)</title>.
